This interactive comic has animated comic panels placed in 3D space, with the camera moving to focus on each panel
as the player navigates through the comic. The comic has multiple loops, with each loop containing a set of panels
displayed in a specific order based on their rank. The player's choices for science, philosophy, and leadership
focus alter art and prose in certain panels. The player can navigate back and forth between panels without
replaying animations.

