SET UP A MINI GAME
─────────────────────────────────────────

ComicPanel_XX_Name (GameObject)
  ├── Step_01_Dialogue      ← AnimatedStep — shown first, non-blocking
  ├── Step_02_Puzzle        ← MiniGame subclass — blocks until Complete() or Fail() called
  │     └── MyPuzzle.cs     ← extends MiniGame; overrides StartGame(); calls Complete()
  └── Step_03_Result        ← AnimatedStep — shown after puzzle finishes
